    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Stop Fishing No Matter What You're Doing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Shores is a <strong>casual online fishing game</strong> you play from the <strong>corner of your desktop</strong> with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With passive yet engaging fishing mechanics, it's designed to let you discretely <strong>play while you work, study, talk, game, or stream!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" width=680 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.mp4?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, passive fishing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resizable corner window for passive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 fish and odd objects to catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable bait and fishing locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful solo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK mode (singeplayer only)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer That Doesn\u2019t Demand Your Attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/e4dea5ca56d971e3529a99cdc928ce3b.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/e4dea5ca56d971e3529a99cdc928ce3b.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Shores is designed to be played passively in the background, meaning you can <strong>fish with friends all day</strong> without needing huge focus.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or host a 4-player server</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your friends' catches\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send emotes to celebrate or silently judge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal interface, low pressure, cosy vibes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Weird Stuff, Unlock Weird Stuff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" width=680 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.mp4?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in over 100 fish and strange objects, from typical lake fish like Perch and Trout to Astro Duckies and Farmer Frogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect objects, you'll unlock new fishing locations and bait. Let the collectathon commence!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught a Blob the Builder Fish? You've just unlocked a cityscape. Caught a Landing Module? Now you can fish in space!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a Social Break in Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from social fishing? No problem -- Strange Shores offers a full-featured singleplayer mode. So you can keep fishing even when your friends are offline.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Stop Fishing No Matter What You're Doing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Shores is a <strong>casual online fishing game</strong> you play from the <strong>corner of your desktop</strong> with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With passive yet engaging fishing mechanics, it's designed to let you discretely <strong>play while you work, study, talk, game, or stream!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" width=680 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/77e8b4eb8db51a9dcee25c3b12935de8.mp4?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, passive fishing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resizable corner window for passive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 fish and odd objects to catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable bait and fishing locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful solo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AFK mode (singeplayer only)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer That Doesn\u2019t Demand Your Attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/e4dea5ca56d971e3529a99cdc928ce3b.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/e4dea5ca56d971e3529a99cdc928ce3b.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange Shores is designed to be played passively in the background, meaning you can <strong>fish with friends all day</strong> without needing huge focus.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join or host a 4-player server</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your friends' catches\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send emotes to celebrate or silently judge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal interface, low pressure, cosy vibes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Weird Stuff, Unlock Weird Stuff</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.poster.avif?t=1747731659\" width=680 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.webm?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593500/extras/f6ce2d5048c4bcbe1a8f4000185b2b9c.mp4?t=1747731659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel in over 100 fish and strange objects, from typical lake fish like Perch and Trout to Astro Duckies and Farmer Frogs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you collect objects, you'll unlock new fishing locations and bait. Let the collectathon commence!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caught a Blob the Builder Fish? You've just unlocked a cityscape. Caught a Landing Module? Now you can fish in space!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take a Social Break in Solo Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a break from social fishing? No problem -- Strange Shores offers a full-featured singleplayer mode. So you can keep fishing even when your friends are offline.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
